            "review_title": "Review at Sushibar Trung Hoa",
            "review_text": "Lucia Thuý\nHakone-machi, Japan96 contributions\n0\nFood overs atmosphere\nApr 2022 • Friends\nFood quality is good, especially the salmon sashimi and the salad. The grilled eel dish is a little salty. The cool soba is just fine. However, I hope to have a chance to feel a quiet and warm atmosphere in case I visit this place again in the future. For me, choosing to dine in a Japanese restaurant is not only for the Japanese cuisine but also for Japanese culture.\nRead more\nWritten May 2, 2022",
